Subject: AlienHand IRC Chat Platform

Description: SOP specification for the AlienHand chat substrate that uses Ergo as the per-app IRC server, thelounge as the human client surface, IRC lines as compact message envelopes, a payload store and resolver as the rich payload provider, JSONL as durable per-channel history, and independent IRC client connections for each AI agent.

